Z||000000||fierodave||10-28-2000||04:08 AM||||<BR>Ok  I am letting the cat out of the bag folks  so here goes<P>Hello all!<BR>I just wanted to let you know <BR>I closed a deal this week (It took over 6 weeks ) and purchased over 45 Fiero's and a very large supply of used Fiero parts!<P>Most of the Fiero's and the parts were acquired originally between 1986 and 1992 so there are some low mile Fiero's (most under 30,000 original miles)  and semi trailers full of some very very nice condition parts!   The parts are from over 30 parted out Fiero's and  the parts and cars  will be available  very soon!<BR>For more details please check out my website<BR> <A HREF="http://www.dreamwater.com/fierodave/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.dreamwater.com/fierodave/index.html</A> <P>I would like to thank all the people that <BR>I have had dealings with in the last two years!  with out you,  I would not have had the opportunity to acquire this collection of Fiero Cars & Parts<P>We look forward to doing business with you again in the near future!<P>Please  give us the week or so needed to video tape, catalog and inventory the stuff, and get some of it moved  before  emailing with a request for parts!<P>Trust me,   we will get some stuff posted on the page for sale on my site asap  <P>We need to get lots of money back as soon as possible  lol!  It will be FUN!!!!!!<P>Thanks for the space<BR>Fierodave<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://members.theglobe.com/fierodave/gifs/fierosig.gif">     <P><p>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 10-28-2000).]||||reg||14
